# clang-format formats C++ only. Named on its command line, it rewrites a
# CMakeLists.txt as C++ (it did to four streams on 2026-10-20, each time
# breaking the SPDX line), so build files are ignored. clang-format 18 has no
# '**', hence one pattern per depth.
CMakeLists.txt
*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/*/*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*/*/*/*/*/*/*/*/CMakeLists.txt
*.cmake
cmake/*.cmake
